# Aircraft Aviation theme

- Make weekly homepage updates by editing `data/home.json`. Do not hardcode that week's photos, news, trip reports, streams, or events into the PHP templates.
- Do not add Node.js, npm, package.json, Docker, or an install script.
- Do not add analytics code to the theme. No tracking pixels, analytics snippets, tag managers, or third-party analytics scripts.
